\subsection{Proof of Theorem~\ref{thm:sgd_homog_convex_acc}}

\THEOREMSGDHOMOGCONVEXACC*

\begin{proof}
    One can see that Accelerated Method~\ref{alg:alg_server} is just the accelerated stochastic gradient method with the batch size $S.$ It means that we can use the classical SGD result (Proposition 4.4 in \citet{lan2020first}). For a stepsize $$\gamma = \min\left\{\frac{1}{4L}, \left[\frac{3 R^2 S}{4 \sigma^2 (K + 1)(K + 2)^2}\right]^{1/2}\right\},$$ we have
